{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "慧觀"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "并序"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "并序上黃供奉書附"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上化主"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上眷屬"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "頔"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "元文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "近加"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "并序"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "慎本不存"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上七十六卷，智者說，聖朝新編入大藏。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "印本開十八卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上二十卷，章安頂禪師撰，同入大藏內。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "印本開十五卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "略大本疏文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上四十九卷，然禪師撰，同入大藏。已上三師，共計一百四十五卷入藏。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "今在日本國"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上四十一卷，智者說，今闕本。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上九卷，智者說，今參入大部。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上三十三卷，智者說，其本現存，但不入大藏。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上三卷，頂禪師撰，闕本。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上八卷，然禪師撰。除補助儀、始終心要、止觀文句，其本現存，餘皆亡之。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "事出付法藏傳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法諱同聖祖"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "并序"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法諱同聖祖"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "欽若"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "元吉"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "釋上本文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "示看讀者大節"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦名次第禪門"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "今五卷是"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "今見行四卷，恐後人合六為四"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四悉、三觀參入大部，今無別行"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦名煎乳論"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "元吉"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "遵式"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "執事"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "了淨、\n可久"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "遵式"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "了淨可久"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "慧觀"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "欽若"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "并序"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "附"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "欽若"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "并"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "若人能誦持此偈，得三種利益：一得常持諸大乘經首題名字，二得增長淨土信心，三令聞者深信淨土。若遇\n臨終者，高聲誦一返二返，然後勸令念佛。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此依元本刊板，近時別行印本，稍有添削，請知。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "五逆者，出佛身血、破和合\n僧、殺阿羅漢、殺父、殺母也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "重罪者，即前五逆也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "并序"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "詩四章，章八句"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "并序"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "出十六觀經"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "附"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "慧觀"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "欽若"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "欽若"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "并序"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "并序"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "欽若"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "欽若"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "遵式"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "遵式"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此言四數雖齊，其旨大遠，\n非問也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "遵\n式"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "遵式"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "由彼秪云佛果二智，不知因缺所乘"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此二智同二乘所得，二乘尚須索車，佛果如何為體"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "智是照理之用，指用為體，顛倒何甚？況下文自有白牛譬智，能所何分"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "今經具論待絕二妙，絕待正在開三成一，故名絕待。待昔為高廣，秪得相\n待，開權不成，正違經意，過莫大焉"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "今家明等賜無\n間於三惡，豈局於果智"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上具寫彼文。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "今文世界一釋"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "今為人悉檀釋"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "今對治悉檀釋"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "第一義悉檀釋也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上錄文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "浮圖即佛陀也。今人從略，止云佛耳。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "淨月"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "并序"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "欽若"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "并序"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見別傳及遺旨"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "禪法律三師，不過出觀心論。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "同僧利者盡歛莫違"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "T19n0985_p0463c20"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "T19n0985_p0463c20"}
